
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#080b18">
  <meta name="description" content="VHVR WEB APP - Futuristic digital dashboard dan pusat pengembangan VHVR BOT.">
  <title>VHVR | Futuristic Web App</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #080b18;
      --panel: #111831;
      --border: #28345a;
      --text: #f4f6ff;
      --muted: #a7b2d3;
      --blue: #7387ff;
      --purple: #b16cff;
      --green: #69f0c0;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
      scroll-padding-top: 90px;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 0%, #29205b66, transparent 40%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 0% 35%, #153b6550, transparent 35%),
        var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, Arial, sans-serif;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    a { color: inherit; }

    header {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 10;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 15px;
      padding: 17px 6%;
      background: #080b18eF;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 23px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
      color: var(--blue);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .logo span { color: white; }

    nav {
      display: flex;
      gap: 18px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    nav a {
      font-size: 13px;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    nav a:hover { color: white; }

    main {
      width: min(1080px, 100%);
      margin: auto;
      padding: 35px 6%;
    }

    .hero { padding: 48px 0 35px; }

    .eyebrow {
      color: var(--purple);
      letter-spacing: 3px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(37px, 9vw, 66px);
      line-height: 1.08;
      letter-spacing: -2px;
      margin: 17px 0;
    }

    .gradient {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #8fa0ff, #d09aff);
      color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
    }

    p {
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.8;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .hero p { max-width: 590px; }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 15px;
      padding: 13px 19px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      color: white;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 13px;
      text-decoration: none;
      background: linear-gradient(110deg, #5369ef, #984be4);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 30px #735bff35;
    }

    .button.secondary {
      background: #151d38;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      box-shadow: none;
      margin-left: 7px;
    }

    .status {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 9px 12px;
      border: 1px solid #24634e;
      border-radius: 30px;
      color: var(--green);
      background: #10312688;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    .dot {
      width: 7px;
      height: 7px;
      background: var(--green);
      border-radius: 50%;
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--green);
    }

    section { margin-top: 45px; }

    .section-head { margin-bottom: 20px; }

    .section-head h2 {
      font-size: 25px;
      margin: 0 0 7px;
    }

    .section-head p { margin: 0; }

    .cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(215px, 1fr));
      gap: 15px;
    }

    .card {
      padding: 22px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 17px;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #151d37, #0c1123);
      transition: transform .2s, border-color .2s;
    }

    .card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      border-color: var(--blue);
    }

    .icon {
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      border-radius: 13px;
      background: #252b53;
      font-size: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .card h3 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 17px; }
    .card p { margin: 0; font-size: 13px; }

    .panel {
      padding: 25px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 17px;
      background: #10162b;
    }

    .panel h3 { margin-top: 0; }

    .tag {
      display: inline-block;
      margin: 4px 5px 4px 0;
      padding: 7px 10px;
      border-radius: 7px;
      color: #c4cbff;
      background: #242b4d;
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    footer {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 25px 6%;
      text-align: center;
      color: #8490b3;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      header { padding: 15px 5%; }
      .logo { font-size: 19px; }
      nav { gap: 10px; }
      nav a { font-size: 12px; }
      main { padding: 25px 5%; }
      .hero { padding-top: 38px; }
      .button.secondary { margin-left: 0; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <a class="logo" href="#beranda" style="text-decoration:none">VHVR<span>.</span></a>
    <nav aria-label="Navigasi utama">
      <a href="#beranda">Beranda</a>
      <a href="#fitur">Fitur</a>
      <a href="#tentang">Tentang</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" id="beranda" style="margin-top:0">
      <div class="eyebrow">NEXT GENERATION DIGITAL EXPERIENCE</div>
      <h1>Welcome to<br><span class="gradient">VHVR WEB APP</span></h1>
      <p>
        Pusat digital VHVR dengan tampilan futuristik, desain modern,
        dan pengalaman yang nyaman di perangkat mobile maupun desktop.
        Mari mulai membangun ekosistem VHVR.
      </p>
      <a class="button" href="#fitur">Jelajahi Fitur ↗</a>
      <a class="button secondary" href="#tentang">Tentang VHVR</a>
    </section>

    <div class="status">
      <span class="dot"></span>
      WEBSITE BERHASIL DIMUAT
    </div>

    <section id="fitur">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Fitur Utama</h2>
        <p>Fondasi awal ekosistem digital VHVR.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="cards">
        <article class="card">
          <div class="icon">🤖</div>
          <h3>VHVR Telegram Bot</h3>
          <p>Persiapkan integrasi bot Telegram, perintah otomatis, dan layanan interaktif.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <div class="icon">⚡</div>
          <h3>Smart Experience</h3>
          <p>Rancang layanan digital yang sederhana, cepat, dan mudah dikembangkan.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <div class="icon">🌌</div>
          <h3>Futuristic Design</h3>
          <p>Antarmuka gelap dengan aksen neon biru dan ungu serta tata letak responsif.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <div class="icon">📱</div>
          <h3>Mobile Friendly</h3>
          <p>Tampilan menyesuaikan ukuran layar HP Android, tablet, dan komputer.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <div class="icon">🛠️</div>
          <h3>Future Development</h3>
          <p>Fondasi untuk penambahan menu, layanan, dan koneksi backend pada tahap berikutnya.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <div class="icon">🔒</div>
          <h3>Pengembangan Aman</h3>
          <p>Jangan menaruh token rahasia atau kata sandi di kode website publik.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="tentang">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Tentang VHVR</h2>
        <p>Membangun pengalaman digital selangkah demi selangkah.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="panel">
        <h3>VHVR Digital Experience</h3>
        <p>
          VHVR WEB APP merupakan halaman depan proyek VHVR.
          Website ini menggunakan HTML dan CSS serta dapat dipublikasikan
          melalui GitHub Pages. Integrasi bot Telegram dan layanan server
          memerlukan konfigurasi terpisah.
        </p>
        <span class="tag">HTML5</span>
        <span class="tag">CSS3</span>
        <span class="tag">Responsive UI</span>
        <span class="tag">GitHub Pages</span>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <strong>VHVR WEB APP</strong><br>
    Explore the Future. Build Beyond Limits.<br>
    © 2026 VHVR. Dibuat untuk pengembangan digital.
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
